// Test: Mutable method returns must be captured
// Spec: 17-JORMUNGANDR-BOOTSTRAP.md § CG-005 Mutable Method Returns
// Priority: P0
//
// Purpose:
// Validates that mutable method returns are properly captured of generated C.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should compile and print Hello World

rite main() {
    ≔ vary s: !String = "Hello";
    s.push_str(" World");
    println(s);
}
